sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant C as Blazor component
    participant T as Typed HttpClient
    participant B as BFF / auth middleware
    participant H as Minimal API handler
    participant S as Azure Table Storage

    U->>C: Start action
    C->>T: Send typed request
    T->>B: Attach same-origin session
    B->>H: Validate auth + route
    H->>S: Execute storage operation
    S-->>H: Return entity or status
    H-->>C: ProblemDetails or success payload
    C-->>U: Render updated state
